Utopia is here. You&#x27;re not impressed.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Future? No Thanks! is a narrative-driven, open-world adventure set in an ecosocialist utopia. The year is 2045, and society has never been better: climate change is finally being tackled, democracy thrives, and technology serves the public good.</p>\r\n<p>There&#x27;s just one problem: you.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>You are Harvey Huffstone, a grumpy elder who no longer fits in, and today is the last day of your life.<br>Your final mission? Completing your bucket list before your self-scheduled euthanasia.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Indulge in outdated pleasures, explore a post-post-industrial Midwest, clash with a society that&#x27;s moved on without you, and maybe, just maybe, leave with fewer regrets.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNDE2MTY3LnBuZw==/original/eVY1d5.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p>Explore a lively city, meet its wacky inhabitants, and complete 7 non-linear quests over 6 hours of gameplay.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNDE2MTg5LnBuZw==/original/OjYYRP.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p>An artisanal game made with locally sourced talent.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNDE2MjAwLnBuZw==/original/Sf849v.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p>In a medium dominated by dystopias, Future? No Thanks! imagines a political project for the present.\r\n</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg width=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapp